WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.520
Start with a book open.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.969
Swipe down to open the menu.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.865
Choose Tools, then More tools.

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.549
Open Typoscope, and enable the reading mask.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.801
With the light mask, tap to move down one line at a time.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.030
To change the look, return to Tools, More tools, and Typoscope.

7
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.791
Open Mask color, and choose Dark.

8
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.381
Keep tapping to move down the page, one line at a time.

9
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.817
Light or dark. Your choice.
